    <updated>2026-11-21T00:34:21Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To remember a new name, link it to a distinctive feature or familiar image, then try recalling it a few minutes later; retrieval strengthens memory.</div>
    </content>
