    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#e41fa3da68d4d616bf58578fdbb386e8dd060c9c271443f53b9fc3532611f332</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-21T00:34:21Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">When a cut heals, nearby skin cells divide and move into the gap, while immune cells help clear debris—your body coordinates repair without conscious direction.</div>
    </content>
