    <updated>2026-11-21T00:34:21Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">For three minutes, tap a rhythm on your knees and invent a matching tune with nonsense syllables; change the beat whenever the melody surprises you.</div>
